## Before Implementing UI

1. Use `DataTable` for list/table views
2. Use `ScrollShadow` for scrollable containers
3. Match existing card styles (content vs poster)
4. Keep layouts visible during loading states
5. Use `@tabler/icons-react` for all icons with semantic colors
